UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::setFeeBps
├── When caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── When new fee exceeds max
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_FeeTooHigh
├── When valid
│   └── It updates feeBps and emits FeeUpdated
└── It charges accrued yield at old rate then switches

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::claimFees
├── When given an explicit recipient
│   └── It sweeps to the passed recipient not the admin
└── When recipient is zero
    └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroAddress

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::pendingFees
└── It remainder bearing delta charges exact floor fee

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::claimFees
└── It transfers a one wei fee

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::constructor
└── It accepts fee equal to max

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::claimFees
└── It zero claim moves nothing and resyncs basis

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::admin
└── It returns owner

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::transferAdmin
├── When caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── It is two step

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::setRewardsController
├── When caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── When valid
    └── It updates the controller and emits RewardsControllerUpdated

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::claimRewards
├── When caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── When controller not set
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_RewardsControllerNotSet
└── It forwards to controller and sends reward to recipient

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::rescueToken
├── When caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── When token is the asset
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_CannotRescueAsset
├── When recipient is zero
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroAddress
├── When valid
│   └── It transfers the stray token and emits TokenRescued
└── It can rescue stray shares

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::setFeeBps
└── Given no yield_ is a no op checkpoint
    └── It changes the fee without accruing anything

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::setRewardsController
└── It overwrite emits old and new

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::renounceOwnership
├── It reverts for admin
└── It reverts for non admin

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::pause
└── When caller is not admin
    └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::unpause
└── When caller is not admin
    └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::pause
├── It blocks deposit and mint
├── It still allows exit and claim
└── When already paused
    └── It should revert with EnforcedPause

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::unpause
├── When not paused
│   └── It should revert with ExpectedPause
├── It after pause allows deposits again
└── It restores max deposit and mint

UnitPPYieldTokenAdmin::pause
└── It zero amount deposit still reverts zero shares
